     2344     then do:
     2345       if frame Dialog-Frame :width + p-change-value < v-diasize-orig-frame-width
     2346       then do:
     2347         assign
     2348           p-change-value = v-diasize-orig-frame-width
     2349                          - frame Dialog-Frame :width
     2350         .
